WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.370
Read the school context. Confirm the selected school and family before reviewing balances. This demo is a simplified billing review screen.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:26.740
Separate the exception types. Payment pending, subsidy review and credit available require different follow-up. Do not treat every balance as collectible.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:40.110
Reconcile before retrying. A pending or processing payment must be checked before another attempt. Match payment, invoice and ledger evidence.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:53.480
Choose the exact task guide. Use the written tuition, invoice, credit, refund or reconciliation tutorial. Creating an invoice does not itself charge a method.

